# Request examples only; these IDs must be explicitly selected from your own test data.
@baseUrl = http://127.0.0.1:8000
@batchId = REPLACE_WITH_BATCH_ID
@referenceId = REPLACE_WITH_MANUAL_ID
@referenceRevision = 1
@aiId = REPLACE_WITH_AI_ID

### Cancel waiting items only. Repeat is safe; running calls continue.
POST {{baseUrl}}/api/v1/evaluation-batches/{{batchId}}/cancel

### Read current progress; creation replay returns the original acceptance snapshot.
GET {{baseUrl}}/api/v1/evaluation-batches/{{batchId}}

### Actual calls and known zero usage for canceled-before-start items.
POST {{baseUrl}}/api/v1/reports/usage
Content-Type: application/json

{"batch_id":"{{batchId}}"}

### Internal quality metrics; no model call. Use null for a missing AI result.
POST {{baseUrl}}/api/v1/reports/quality
Content-Type: application/json

{
  "pairs": [{
    "reference_id": "{{referenceId}}",
    "reference_revision": {{referenceRevision}},
    "ai_id": "{{aiId}}"
  }]
}
